     University of Calgary and the Hebrew University of Jerusalem all file a US
     Form 990 and all appear above the revenue floor in the batch this source
     was measured on. Assuming the United States would put them on the American
     map. Below the default revenue floor on purpose as well, so one fixture
     covers both guards. -->
